
# type(scope): short imperative summary  (max 72 characters)
#
# Types : feat | fix | security | perf | refactor | docs | test | build | chore | revert
# Scopes: api | auth | agent | audit | plan | demo | llm | voice | front | i18n | config | iis | repo
#
# Body (optional): why the change is needed and what it affects.
#
# Refs: #<issue>
# BREAKING CHANGE: <description>   (only for incompatible changes)
#
# See CONTRIBUTING.md. Lines starting with '#' are ignored.
